{"uid": "mfg-1914-14-02", "question_type": "explanatory", "question_subtype": "shortfall_cause", "raw_text": "Based on the data from Plant 1914, Period 14, day 187:\n\nFrom the daily ledger:\n- ATN01K24P: ordered 6287, shipped 4996, backordered 1291, ending stock 4544\n- Available stock for ATN01K24P = 5040 (stock from day 186) + 4500 (produced day 187) = 9540 units, which is sufficient for the 6287-unit order\n\nFrom the Events: dispatch capacity was reached on day 187 (192927.60 of 192950 kg dispatched).\n\nThe dispatch order on day 187 (all same-day orders, sorted by quantity ascending): ATWWP001K24P (5), SE200G24P (97), MAHS025K (222), SE500G24P (1223), AT5X5K (1248), MAR01K24P (1400), ATN01K24P (6287). ATN01K24P is last.\n\nCapacity remaining when ATN01K24P was served: 119926.4 kg, allowing 4996 units (119904 kg). The remaining 1291 units needed 30984 kg but only 22.4 kg capacity remained.\n\n- **Choice 0**: Stock was sufficient (9540 > 6287). NOT responsible.\n- **Choice 1**: If MAR01K24P (1400 \u00d7 24 = 33600 kg) hadn't used capacity, ATN01K24P would have had 153526.4 kg available, enough for 6287 units (150888 kg). Responsible.\n- **Choice 2**: If capacity had not been reached (more capacity available), ATN01K24P would have shipped fully given sufficient stock. Responsible.\n- **Choice 3**: If AT5X5K (1248 \u00d7 25 = 31200 kg) hadn't used capacity, ATN01K24P would have had 151126.4 kg available, enough for 6287 units (150888 kg). Responsible.\n\n{\"choices\": {\"0\": false, \"1\": true, \"2\": true, \"3\": true}}", "parsed": {"choices": {"0": false, "1": true, "2": true, "3": true}}, "score": {"question_correct": true, "options_correct": 4, "options_total": 4}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 168326, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 27530, "reasoning_tokens": 26652, "llm_calls": 0, "total_tokens": 195856}, "latency_s": 430.06, "trace": {"finish_reason": "stop"}}
