{"uid": "mfg-1914-14-04", "question_type": "counterfactual", "question_subtype": "capacity", "raw_text": "Based on my analysis of Plant 1914, Period 14 with the reduced dispatch capacity of 154,360 kg per day from day 188 onward:\n\n**Tracing the key days:**\n\n**Days 188-189:** Dispatch volumes are well under the reduced capacity, so no new backlogs accumulate beyond what was already there (MAHS025K 210-unit backlog from day 187 persists on day 188, then clears on day 189).\n\n**Day 190:** Original dispatch was 192,930.6 kg (at capacity). With 154,360 kg capacity, using lowest-quantity-first priority among same-day orders:\n- ATWWP001K24P (62), SE200G24P (187), MAR01K24P (1607), SE500G24P (1675), AT5X5K (2103) ship fully = 103,578.6 kg\n- ATN01K24P: only 2,115 of 8,819 units ship (50,760 kg), leaving 6,704 backordered\n\n**Day 191:** The 6,704 ATN01K24P backlog from day 190 (160,896 kg) alone exceeds the 154,360 kg capacity. Only 6,431 ATN01K24P units ship. All day 191 orders (including SE200G24P's 60 units) remain backordered.\n\n**Day 192:** Day 190 ATN01K24P remainder (273 units) plus day 191 backlogs are prioritized. Capacity is consumed clearing older backlogs, leaving day 192 orders (including SE200G24P's 53 units) unshipped. **SE200G24P has 53 backordered units at end of day 192.** \u2713\n\n**Day 193:** Significant accumulated ATN01K24P backlogs from days 190-192 are prioritized first. The day 193 ATN01K24P order (2,816 units) does not ship at all due to capacity being consumed by older backlogs. **MAHS025K also has backordered units** (stock of 25 with 55-unit backlog from day 192 plus 5-unit day 193 order). \u2713\n\n**Days 194-196:** Continued capacity constraints with accumulated backlogs mean day 196 orders (including MAR01K24P's 80 units) would not ship in full, as older backlogs are prioritized first.\n\n{\"choices\": {\"0\": true, \"1\": true, \"2\": false, \"3\": false}}", "parsed": {"choices": {"0": true, "1": true, "2": false, "3": false}}, "score": {"question_correct": false, "options_correct": 3, "options_total": 4}, "usage": {"input_tokens": 69944, "cached_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 42729, "reasoning_tokens": 41905, "llm_calls": 0, "total_tokens": 112673}, "latency_s": 587.61, "trace": {"finish_reason": "stop"}}
